1,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"版权商务助理（实习生）(J10825)","OrgId":2468908,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"3","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.流程执行：协助处理版权商务的OA内部流程（合同发起、流转、归档），确保节点无遗漏、零差错。\n2.数据整理：汇总商务调研数据，定期跟踪并更新行业动态报表，保持数据鲜活准确。\n3.内容监测：监测固定合作方的短剧内容更新，及时同步最新物料，保障团队协作信息同频。\n4.视频物料： 视频素材物料的梳理检查，个别素材的处理或优化。","Require":"1.核心素质（最重要）：踏实细心，执行力强。对数字和流程高度敏感，凡事有交代，件件有着落。\n2.语言能力：英语读写良好，能无障碍阅读英文合同/行业资讯，具备基础口语沟通能力。\n3.行业认知：熟悉海外短剧生态（如ReelShort等），是重度短剧用户或有相关调研经验。\n4.加分项：对AI视频/生成式工具有强烈好奇心， 业务涉及AI视频生成业务，如果你对AI视频生成工具比较擅长或了解是加分项；\n注：本岗位提供真实的上市公司业务实战环境，不设一对一保姆式培训，需要您具备极强的快速自学与适应能力。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-03-03T17:22:06","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null},{"Id":"e214c237-c62e-4448-9429-4bcb7a3b60e6","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":230878201,"PostDateInt":0,"PostDate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"海外短剧商务经理(J10803)","OrgId":2468908,"Org":null,"Category":null,"CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":[],"Salary":null,"Duty":"1.负责公司原创竖屏短剧内容在海外市场（北美、欧洲、东南亚、中东、日韩，印度等）的商务拓展与销售，包括但不限于平台合作、版权授权、联合出品等；\n2.主动开发并维护海外主流媒体平台、流媒体服务商、短视频平台、本地发行商及内容采购方等客户关系（如Netflix、Amazon Freevee、TikTok、Viki、YouTube 等）；\n3.独立完成从客户接洽、需求分析、方案定制、价格谈判到合同签署及回款跟进的全流程；\n4.深入理解各国家/地区用户的观看偏好与市场趋势，精准捕捉客户需求，灵活调整内容推荐策略与合作方案；\n5.达成明确的季度/年度销售指标，对业绩结果负责。","Require":"1.英语口语沟通流利（CET-6以上或雅思6.5+/托福90+，能无障碍进行商务谈判），具备跨文化沟通能力；\n2.对国际影视、网络文学、短视频、Web Drama、Reels等主流文娱形态有浓厚兴趣和基本认知；\n3.熟悉海外主流视频平台生态（如YouTube、TikTok、Instagram Reels、Facebook Watch、Roku、Samsung TV Plus、Pluto TV、Freevee、Viki、DramaBox、ReelShort等）及其内容采购逻辑者优先；\n4.具备强自驱力与抗压能力，能主动开拓新客户，不依赖既有资源；\n5.有1年以上海外内容销售、版权商务、影视发行、广告BD或跨境文娱相关经验者优先；\n6.结果导向，能接受明确的KPI考核，对数据敏感，执行力强；\n7.有耐心、细致、善于倾听，能灵活应对客户多变需求。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":null,"Channel4IsHot":false,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-02-05T17:50:43","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null}],"Total":0}